{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301341","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301341","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1430134101:0":{"text":"違うよ、フェリダ家の子たち。家族は今出稼ぎに行ってるから、預かってるんだ。","source_cn":"这是弗瑞达家的火鸡，弗瑞达一家都离开村子，去外面闯荡了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FCC606DE6C386D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430134102:0":{"text":"最近手紙が届いてね。鍛冶屋の商売も繫盛してるらしいよ！","source_cn":"最近弗瑞达给我写信，他们在外面的铁匠铺生意挺好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5B9BE98C86FDE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430134103:0":{"text":"だから、戻ってくるまでは、この子たちを大事に育ててあげなきゃなって……","source_cn":"弗瑞达回来以前，我要替她照顾好这些火鸡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A6583814124B724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人布斯丽":{"text":"ドワーフのブスリ","source":"矮人布斯丽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}